n sim.\r\n\r\n1. Redux delivers state to refreshing prop on flatlist\r\n2. Redux state prints out correctly setting loading boolean to false\r\n3. spinner continues to display even if setState or forceUpdate (loading: false) is called manually in a subsequent timeout\r\n\r\nExpected\r\nSpinner hides once loading is set to false\r\n\r\nActual\r\nSpinner continues to display even after redux sets loading to false on refreshing prop in flatlist\r\n\r\nSetting a breakpoint resolves the issue. Sounds like a race condition due to my loading boolean being dependent on an async redux action.","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/facebook/react-native/issues/comments/431476807/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"event":"commented","actor":{"login":"alexhidalgo","id":5232184,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUyMzIxODQ=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5232184?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexhidalgo","html_url":"https://github.com/alexhidalgo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexhidalgo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexhidalgo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexhidalgo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexhidalgo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexhidalgo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexhidalgo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexhidalgo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexhidalgo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexhidalgo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false}},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/facebook/react-native/issues/comments/431493241","html_url":"https://github.com/facebook/react-nativ